-- The Hinterlands: the wildlife on its sniffed spots.
-- Sourced: the Cataclysm Classic TDB 4.4.2 spawns of Silvermane Wolf 2924, Mangy Silvermane 2923, Silvermane Howler 2925,
-- Vicious Owlbeast 2927, Primitive Owlbeast 2928 and Saltwater Snapjaw 2505 in the zone (the retail TDB 1210 has the same rows):
-- position, orientation, MovementType and wander distance. The TDB gives these entries no addons, paths, pools or events, and
-- mop_world spawns them nowhere outside The Hinterlands. Two TDB wolves are in phase 169, which is Phase.dbc's "Normal".
-- Ours: the old spawns go with their 16 patrol paths and 40 addons (none pooled, in an event, in a formation or referenced by
-- SmartAI); the respawn timers and current health/mana stay mop's per-entry values (the TDB's 120 s is TrinityCore's default,
-- not a sniffed timer); areaId from the area grid; one Silvermane Howler raised 3.5 yd onto the terrain at 182.0, -3549.65.
-- Counts (mop -> TDB): Silvermane Wolf 20 -> 9, Mangy Silvermane 37 -> 19, Silvermane Howler 28 -> 25, Vicious Owlbeast 15 -> 26,
-- Primitive Owlbeast 31 -> 33, Saltwater Snapjaw 53 -> 81.


